<title>UK: SEK sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>SEK sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank BV.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY    28.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  101.40    PAY DATE   S28.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.375     REOFFER    99.40     SPREAD	+3 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-5	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  2.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND - NOV.04 BUND</p>
<p> NOTES	**STEPS UP TO 7.0 PCT FOR LAST FOUR YEARS</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME. S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
